{"id":"3b58881258ad43e4","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-relrandom-oracle-monotonicity.md","title":"随机性对预言机强度逆单调","display":"thm-relrandom-oracle-monotonicity — 随机性对预言机强度逆单调","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-relrandom-oracle-monotonicity","aliases":["43-thm-relrandom-oracle-monotonicity"],"display":"thm-relrandom-oracle-monotonicity — 随机性对预言机强度逆单调","depends_on":["[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-mltest]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-relrandom-oracle-monotonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-relrandom-oracle-monotonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relrandom-oracle-monotonicity — 随机性对预言机强度逆单调"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；相对随机性、归约、相对检验见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\\)</span> 是以集合预言机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为参数的同域谓词族，相对形式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_TB\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_TB\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：B能模拟A的所有统一枚举，故每个A检验也是B检验。A≡_TB时两种随机性等价。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；相对随机性、归约、相对检验见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-mltest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；相对随机性、归约、相对检验见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-mltest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；相对随机性、归约、相对检验见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-mltest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 是以集合预言机 $B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为参数的同域谓词族，相对形式见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 是以集合预言机 $B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为参数的同域谓词族，相对形式见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_TB\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}(X).","display":true}],"bytes":1469,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-relrandom-oracle-monotonicity]] — 随机性对预言机强度逆单调"}],"outgoing":["75e7e3b6eeecc95e","0784d1de3a88cd94","e738767b1d98289f","0586e0fd0301d605"]}